     "en": [
      "learn to tolerate boring repetition"
     ],
     "texte": "1. [[Baltosios naktys]], Dostojevskis"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "most success is less",
      "exciting than it looks"
     ],
     "texte": "keturios naktys, du nepažįstamieji ant tilto"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "it’s doing the same",
      "useful things for",
      "months after the",
      "novelty disappears"
     ],
     "texte": "ji laukia kito, o tu vis tiek [[kiekviename puslapyje sergi už jį]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "consistency gets powerful when other people get bored",
      "and move on"
     ],
     "texte": "apie 70 puslapių, [[trumpiausia širdgėla, kokią kada skaitysi]]"
    }
   },
